1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,060
Welcome to Earthbeat, your top-rated, environmental radio program.

2
00:00:04,440 --> 00:00:05,760
First, let's go to the news.

3
00:00:06,120 --> 00:00:08,180
We have some sad news to announce today.

4
00:00:08,740 --> 00:00:14,320
The federal government has decided to discontinue funding for environmental science on ABC Radio.

5
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:20,340
This will mean that Earthbeat will no longer be broadcast after the last program in this series airs in November.

6
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:27,000
A government spokesperson said, however, that funding will be increased for pure science and business reporting.

7
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:29,360
Let's move to our first special report.

8
00:00:30,120 --> 00:00:39,820
We have in our studio a very special guest: it's Amy McIntyre, the distinguished botanist and author of several prize-winning books on the flora of New Guinea.

9
00:00:40,440 --> 00:00:42,720
She'll be talking to our reporter, Jim Cross.
